#### text ####
text: The trip got off to an inauspicious start, since we discovered at the airport that Dad's wallet had gone missing. To our great relief, it had only been left on the plane, and the staff were able to fetch it for us.
#### text ####
text: After solving the wallet misadventures, we took a taxi to our rented house near Ueno - unusual for us but easier than taking the train with our luggage. It was unexpectedly chilly in Japan during the trip (near freezing!), and we arrived to find the heat had not been turned on before our arrival. Brr! Fortunately there were heaters in every room and it warmed up quickly.
#### location ####
text: Asakusa
----
lat: 35.7147651
----
lon: 139.7966553
#### text ####
text: The first morning we explored Asakusa! The tourist info building had a great view of the skytree and Sensoji.
