#### text ####
text: There's actually both a Buddhist temple to Kannon (Sensō-ji) and a Shinto shrine (Asakusa) on the same grounds, as is common in Japan. Sensoji is Tokyo's oldest temple and the main attraction, while Asakusa was built to honor the men who founded Sensoji. The architecture is very different from European churches!
