#### text ####
text: Since I had been there before, I spent more time with the historical maps and stations and enjoyed several references to places we'd visited on other trips. The first train line in Japan ran from Shimbashi (in Tokyo) to Yokohama (south of Tokyo, which we visited later this trip), as shown on this map. James and I had visited Old Shimbashi Station, where we learned that they didn't have the original schematics or complete photos of the building, so this model (and the building we visited) are best-guess reconstructions.
