#### location ####
text: The Sumida Hokusai Museum
----
lat: 35.6963313
----
lon: 139.800414
#### text ####
text: Mom had found the Sumida Hokusai museum, about the artist that made the Great Wave, and was very interested in it. Despite being small, I really enjoyed it and learned a lot.
#### image-collection ####
images:

##### image #####
image: OcWYmbt-BibO3Ii7-EuFeYUfEAQ.jpg
