#### text ####
text: While he's most famous for The Great Wave Off Kanagawa, he did tons of wood block prints over his long life, and innovated several new techniques for wood block printing. I think I like the waterfall one better than Great Wave because of its clever re-use of colors in the people's clothing.
#### image-collection ####
images:

