-----
alt: 
-----
css_classes: 
-----
caption: 
-----
video_link: 
#### text ####
text: He worked in a mass media (even though it doesn't seem like that today!) and made a much greater variety of art than I'd realized, from party invitations to what was basically tourism marketing prints. Unfortunately they were all in the section of the museum that didn't allow photos.
#### text ####
text: He was a famous artist even in his own time and people wanted to learn from him, so he published several notebooks with his sketches and learn-to-draw examples. The artistry is beautiful!
