#### location ####
text: NIPPORI FABRIC TOWN
----
lat: 35.728797199999995
----
lon: 139.7774087
#### text ####
text: On our final day in Tokyo we visited Nippori Fabric Town, a street full of fabric shops. Mom and I really enjoyed browsing all the stores, including the famous 5-storey Tomato fabric store. Despite her enthusiasm to visit, Mom didn't buy any fabric, while I bought 9 meters!
