#### location ####
text: Okonomiyaki Mizuno
----
lat: 34.668354799999996
----
lon: 135.5032225
#### text ####
text: Right after we arrived I took them to Okonomiyaki Mizuno, a Michelin starred restaurant that we'd visited on our first trip. Last time we came, it was 30+ minute wait, they took your order in line, and it was ready when you sat down. This time, we walked up with 5 people and they could seat us immediately! I was very surprised, but I guess that's the benefit of visiting in the off season.
#### text ####
text: Okonomiyaki is sometimes called savoury Japanese pancakes. It's made of a batter and cabbage with a bunch of different toppings. We ordered several things to share, and they cooked it on the hot plate built into the table right in front of us. Delicious!
