-----
alt: 
-----
css_classes: 
-----
caption: 
-----
video_link: 
#### text ####
text: My family went in to enjoy the castle itself, which is also a museum on the history of the castle and the historical events that led to its construction (and destruction). Andrew had been watching the new TV series "Shōgun" which covers the same time period, and enjoyed seeing the historical basis of many of the events and military strategies he'd seen in the show. It also has a lovely view of the city from the top!
