#### text ####
text: James and I wanted to go out for breakfast when the others didn't, so we found the only cafe in the neighbourhood that was open before 10am. All the seating was outdoors (so a little chilly, even with the heater), but the rich and fluffy caramel french toast was worth it. We liked it so much we took everyone else there before we left Osaka!
