#### text ####
text: The last museum we visited in Osaka was the Museum of Housing and Living, which contained a life size reconstruction of a couple of streets from Edo period (1800s) Osaka. The main drag was full of shops, an onsen, a fancy house and the neighbourhood meeting hall. We got a brief demonstration of some historic and extremely clever security options for the shops.
#### image-collection ####
images:

##### image #####
image: xZCgtYjckKp8R7EsFUd3uiGDCfI.jpg
-----
alt: 
-----
css_classes: 
