#### text ####
text: Our last full day in Tokyo, we visited TeamLab Planets. It's a contemporary art museum, and an experience that is hard to capture (but we sure tried, based on how many photos we took!).
#### text ####
text: It's a full sensory experience - the strangest exhibit has you walking through knee high water while digital fish swim around you.
