#### text ####
text: On our final day in Japan we visited Yokohama, just south of Tokyo. First stop was the Ramen Museum, with an animatronic bowl of ramen outside to welcome you.
#### image-collection ####
images:

##### image #####
image: yokohama-ramen.jpg
