#### text ####
text: Inside is a history of how ramen was invented and popularized, but the main draw is the ramen food court. Styled after a Showa-era (mid 1900s) street, it has a rotating collection of tiny ramen restaurants where you can try different regional styles. We wanted to try them all, but we got full after only two bowls!
